// Call and response in box 1 of A minor pentatonic, swung. The call (bar 1) climbs and stops on G,
// a question; bar 2 is space. The answer (bar 3) comes back down to A; bar 4 is space.
\title "Call and response in A"
\tempo 90
\track ("Guitar" "Gtr.") { instrument acousticguitarsteel }
